  "events = S592 E5/E6/E7 with AMENDMENT 1 (a revisited play id is still an event; gap_negative rows skipped)",
  "receipt_minus_event = response_end_utc - play clock, negative lags kept; with no offset journal the pooled Counter equals the S592 play_lag Counter on the same shards",
